# JWT Authentication using Spring Boot

A simple JWT (JSON Web Token) Authentication project built using **Spring Boot**, **Spring Security**, **Spring Data JPA**, and **MySQL**.

This project demonstrates:

- User Registration
- User Login
- Password Encryption using BCrypt
- JWT Token Generation
- JWT Token Validation
- Protected APIs using Spring Security

---

# Tech Stack

- Java 21
- Spring Boot 3.x
- Spring Security
- Spring Data JPA
- MySQL 8
- JWT (JJWT)
- Maven
- Lombok
- Postman

---

